  _nameCharacther: Leone
  _word:
  - "* A traveler\u2014it's been a while since I've seen one around here. What brings
    you to this place?"
  - "* You want to leave? That\u2019s practically impossible... but maybe there\u2019s
    someone who could help you perform such a miracle."
  - "* This person is further south from here, but the forest they\u2019re in will
    be a real challenge."
